                <run fontcolor='#df2c79' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Overview / How to Use</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#c9d1d9' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>❗</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>How to use this sheet:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Identify which markets are overperforming against the MTD APAC average - only available for aggregatable metrics</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Legend</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>: </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cc0033' fontsize='8'>Pink</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> represents M-1 MTD performance, </run>
